--- !u!114 &742647480
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 742647478}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2a6cf2bc72ef5f640bb3ba3b7141a3f3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialMessages:
  - Hey, I'm gonna teach you a little bit about being a lumberjack. Let's head to
    the next section on the right.
  - Now its time to chop down your first tree. Please hit the tree a few times until
    it is ready to fall.
  - Great now knock the tree down.
  - Nice work! Now we need to replant the trees after we knock them down. Like my
    Pa always says, taking care of the forest is the most important part of the job.
  - Let me teach you a trick. You can hit trees into other trees to cause a chain
    reaction and make them all fall down. Go up to each tree and hit them in the
    direction you want them to fall. Once all the trees are lined up, make one fall.
  - Great work, you're a natural. Now keep an eye out for bushes and interesting
    piles of dirt when you are exploring. They may have items inside.
  - 'Ok last test, look for the greenish tree that looks diffrent from the others.
    That''s a treasure tree. If you hit that tree last you will get some extra rewards.
    Try setting up the trees so they knock that one down last. You got this! '
  - Alright that's about it for the basics, you can figure the rest out in the forest.
    Whenever you are ready go interact with that wagon.
  tutorialAlternateMessages:
  - Um, could you move to the right please?
  - Are you a little nervous? That's ok take your time.
  - Take your time, I'm not going anywhere.
  - Hey I know it may be boring but we have to replant the trees after knocking them
    down or the forest will suffer.
  - Let me teach you a trick. You can hit trees into other trees to cause a chain
    reaction and make them all fall down. Go up to each tree and hit them in the
    direction you want them to fall. Once all the trees are lined up, make one fall.
  - Um, you see thoses bushes and that pile of dirt over there? Could you go and
    get the items inside, thanks.
  - Good effort! Let's just move on please, I have things to do today.
  - Alright that's about it for the basics, you can figure the rest out in the forest.
    Whenever you are ready go interact with that wagon.
  tutUIManager: {fileID: 351016368}
  objectsToDisableDuringTut: []
  objectsToDisablePostTut:
  - {fileID: 58517461}
  - {fileID: 351016367}
  inTut: 0
